### ============================================================
### 多租户维保工单系统 · 核心接口示例
### 适用于 IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client
### 说明：健康检查、三端登录、租户 CRUD、当前用户/权限菜单、退出、修改密码、
###       租户端菜单树、角色管理和用户管理可直接调用；工单等接口是后续里程碑的设计示例。
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8090
@platformToken = 替换为平台登录返回的 token
@tenantToken = 替换为租户登录返回的 token
@techToken = 替换为技师登录返回的 token
@tenantCode = T0001
@newTenantCode = T1001
@newAdminUsername = tenant_admin
@newAdminPassword = 替换为新增租户返回的初始密码
@oldPassword = admin123
@newPassword = NewPass123
@requestId = 01JABCDEF00000000000000001

### 健康检查（白名单）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### 平台登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/platform/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 租户登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantCode": "{{tenantCode}}",
  "username": "tenant_admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 新租户初始管理员登录（密码来自新增租户响应，仅返回一次）
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantCode": "{{newTenantCode}}",
  "username": "{{newAdminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{newAdminPassword}}"
}

### 技师登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/technician/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantCode": "{{tenantCode}}",
  "username": "technician",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 技师端-当前用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/technician/user/info
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician

### 技师端-权限菜单
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/technician/user/auth
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician

### 平台端-当前用户
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/platform/user/info
satoken: {{platformToken}}
client-code: platform

### 平台端-权限菜单
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/platform/user/auth
satoken: {{platformToken}}
client-code: platform

### 当前用户信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/user/info
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant

### 当前用户权限/菜单
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/user/auth
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant

### 退出登录（当前 token 立即失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/logout
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant

### 修改密码（成功后当前 token 失效，需要用新密码重新登录）
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/tenant/password/change
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{oldPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### 平台端-退出登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/platform/logout
satoken: {{platformToken}}
client-code: platform

### 平台端-修改密码（成功后当前 token 失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/api/platform/password/change
satoken: {{platformToken}}
client-code: platform
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "{{oldPassword}}",
  "newPassword": "{{newPassword}}"
}

### 租户端-菜单树（包含按钮节点，供角色分配菜单）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/menu/tree
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant

### 租户端-角色分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/role/page
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20
}

### 租户端-新增角色
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/role/create
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleCode": "dispatcher",
  "roleName": "调度员",
  "dataScope": 2
}

### 租户端-编辑角色（uid 换成角色新增返回的值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/role/update
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为角色 uid",
  "roleName": "高级调度员",
  "dataScope": 2,
  "status": 1
}

### 租户端-分配角色菜单（uid 换成角色新增返回的值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/role/menus
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为角色 uid",
  "menuUids": ["MENU0010", "MENU0011", "MENU0012"]
}

### 租户端-删除角色（逻辑删除，编码可复用；系统角色或已分配用户的角色不可删）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/role/delete
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为角色 uid"
}

### 租户端-用户分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/page
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20
}

### 租户端-新增用户（初始密码仅返回一次）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/create
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "dispatcher01",
  "nickname": "调度员一号",
  "email": "dispatcher@example.com",
  "roleUids": ["替换为角色 uid"]
}

### 租户端-编辑用户（uid 换成用户分页返回的值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/update
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为用户 uid",
  "nickname": "调度员一号-改",
  "roleUids": ["替换为角色 uid"]
}

### 租户端-重置用户密码（新密码仅返回一次，目标用户登录态失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/reset-password
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为用户 uid"
}

### 租户端-用户启停（停用后目标用户登录态失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/status
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为用户 uid",
  "status": 0
}

### 租户端-删除用户（逻辑删除，登录名可复用；删除后目标用户登录态失效）
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/user/delete
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为用户 uid"
}

### 平台端-租户分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/api/tenant/page
satoken: {{platformToken}}
client-code: platform
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "tenantName": "维保"
}

### 平台端-新增租户（同步创建初始管理员，初始密码仅返回一次）
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/api/tenant/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantCode": "T1001",
  "tenantName": "测试维保公司",
  "contactName": "李四",
  "contactMobile": "13800000000",
  "maxUserCount": 20,
  "adminUsername": "tenant_admin",
  "adminNickname": "租户管理员",
  "remark": "M1 演示"
}

### 新增租户响应示例（data.initialPassword 需要妥善保存）
# {
#   "code": 0,
#   "msg": "success",
#   "data": {
#     "uid": "租户业务ID",
#     "tenantCode": "T1001",
#     "adminUsername": "tenant_admin",
#     "adminUserUid": "管理员业务ID",
#     "initialPassword": "Fg@a1b2c3d4e5f6"
#   }
# }

### 平台端-租户详情（M1 可直接调用，uid 换成新增返回的值）
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/api/tenant/detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为新增租户返回的 uid"
}

### 平台端-编辑租户（M1 可直接调用）
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/api/tenant/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为新增租户返回的 uid",
  "tenantName": "测试维保公司-改名",
  "contactName": "王五",
  "maxUserCount": 30
}

### 平台端-启停租户（M1 可直接调用）
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/api/tenant/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "替换为新增租户返回的 uid",
  "status": 0
}

### 租户端-工单分页
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/page
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "status": "PENDING",
  "priority": 3,
  "keyword": "空调"
}

### 租户端-创建工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/create
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerUid": "C0000000000000000000000000000001",
  "equipmentUid": "E0000000000000000000000000000001",
  "title": "空调不制冷",
  "description": "3 楼会议室空调开机后不制冷，出风口有异响",
  "priority": 3,
  "expectTime": "2026-11-17 10:00:00",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "fileName": "1.jpg",
      "fileKey": "workorder/2026/11/16/demo-1.jpg",
      "fileType": 1
    }
  ]
}

### 租户端-派单
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/assign
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "technicianUid": "T0000000000000000000000000000001",
  "remark": "请尽快上门",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 租户端-取消工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/cancel
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "cancelReason": "客户临时取消",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 租户端-确认完工
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/confirm
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "remark": "验收通过",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 租户端-工单日志
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/log/page
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001"
}

### 技师端-我的工单
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/page
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "status": "ASSIGNED"
}

### 技师端-接单
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/accept
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 技师端-拒单
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/reject
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "reason": "不在服务区域",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 技师端-开始处理
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/start
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 技师端-完工
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/complete
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician
X-Request-Id: {{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderUid": "WO000000000000000000000000000001",
  "finishRemark": "更换电容，已恢复",
  "attachments": [
    {
      "fileName": "after.jpg",
      "fileKey": "workorder/2026/11/16/demo-after.jpg",
      "fileType": 1
    }
  ],
  "requestId": "{{requestId}}"
}

### 技师端-今日概览
POST {{baseUrl}}/technician/api/work-order/today
satoken: {{techToken}}
client-code: technician

### 文件预签名
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/file/presign
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "1.jpg",
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "bizType": "WORK_ORDER"
}

### 文件确认
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/file/confirm
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileKey": "workorder/2026/11/16/demo-1.jpg",
  "fileName": "1.jpg",
  "fileType": 1,
  "bizType": "WORK_ORDER"
}

### 创建导出任务
POST {{baseUrl}}/tenant/api/work-order/export
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pageNum": 1,
  "pageSize": 20,
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 导出任务状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/export/task/status
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskUid": "EX000000000000000000000000000001"
}

### 导出任务下载
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/export/task/download
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "taskUid": "EX000000000000000000000000000001"
}

### 字典数据
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/dict/data/work_order_status
satoken: {{tenantToken}}
client-code: tenant
